  "title": "IoT – It’s all about data insights",
  "summary": "The Internet of Things (IoT) is set to generate vast amounts of new data, with some predictions citing that over 100 billion “things” will send out data over the Internet by 2020. Without new analysis methods, this sheer volume at best risks the value of data being lost and, at worst, may overwhelm a business completely. To make sure we create value from all this data, we need to concentrate on generating insights that businesses can use.",
